 "version": 1,
 "_about": "Procedural clip fallbacks (docs/pivot/combat_api.md section 5). When a model lacks a contract clip, scripts/combat/fx/procedural_moves.gd builds a short Animation from these key poses so gameplay never waits on a clip. Bone values are degrees about the MODEL's axes: [x, y, z] with x positive = the bone's top tips forward, y positive = turns toward her left, z leans toward her left. 'squash' stretches the root (negative = squash), 'lift' raises or lowers the hips in metres. Times are fractions of the clip length. 'clips' maps each contract clip name to a fallback and its default length in seconds.",
